# PRE-DEPLOY CHECKLIST (check before merging to main):
#
#   [ ] Code is on `develop` branch (never commit features directly to main)
#   [ ] All backend tests pass: JWT_SECRET=test_secret python3 -m pytest tests/ -x -q
#   [ ] Staging verified with authenticated API call (not just /api/health)
#   [ ] New migrations tracked in _applied_migrations? (no bare UPDATE leads)
#   [ ] Any DDL has lock_timeout set?
#   [ ] Release note added to docs/RELEASES.md?
#   [ ] /api/health/deep returns db_tables_accessible: true on staging?
#
# If any box is unchecked → DO NOT merge to main.
# Run scripts/pre-deploy-check.sh to verify interactively.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
